{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lift the Evil Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a fallen knight, resurrected within an abandoned castle shrouded in darkness. The only path to freedom lies in completing a sacred ritual to banish the monstrous Jester who stalks these halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run through the castle will feel the same. You\u2019ll need to adapt to different spawns, lingering traps, and unpredictable encounters. Beware of the Jester\u2019s twisted jack boxes scattered throughout the corridors. Trigger one and you\u2019ll summon your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.poster.avif?t=1765190019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.webm?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.mp4?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together or Die Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in online co-op for a terrifying shared experience. Stay close for safety, or split up to cover ground faster, but remember: communication is limited through proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rune you collect brings you closer to freedom, but it also enrages the Jester. As you progress, he grows faster, smarter, and more relentless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.poster.avif?t=1765190019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.webm?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.mp4?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-Player Online Co-op</strong>\u00a0- Face the Jester alone or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong>\u00a0- Whisper, shout, or stay silent. Every sound matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jester Sound React</strong> - The Jester has a keen ear, don't make too much noise or you'll attract him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>\u00a0- Each run is  different with new  rune locations, different spawns, key locations,...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Modes</strong>\u00a0- Choose the level of terror that suits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio Design</strong>\u00a0- Feel your heartbeat as the Jester closes in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI</strong>\u00a0- The Jester  grows more dangerous the closer you get to finishing the ritual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Have What It Takes to Lift the Jester\u2019s Curse?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the runes, complete the ritual, and survive the hunt. The Jester is waiting.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No help needed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/4027dd531886921250bf5de13667e4c1db2d4a18.jpg"},{"name":"The more the merrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/f162766f3115833628e5d422a6fe33c834b72270.jpg"},{"name":"Exorcised","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/1aa096fef1d07ae7deca04aaf0b7856a6f60428d.jpg"},{"name":"Just getting started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/0f189a060c9dbf8861a1bccd3d6b2a361c687a44.jpg"},{"name":"Is that all you got?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/333ba6ecb6ee3d2a4bb94b243367b4c858829120.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/3dfa8e6da0240febbcc5ef4e3f4a08c79cd40fcb.jpg"},{"name":"Hardly a challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/b584c435c138cbc7bb6cdeaa9c01332726621cbe.jpg"},{"name":"Can you even be stopped?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/628a540ea0f9d1c4ca0b898b69fccc47cb4117e2.jpg"},{"name":"Not on my watch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/8a555237c9959de3ecd6dce247ab98d560e68500.jpg"},{"name":"Get up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3607770/cafe18d2342c84ffcc4ea02c80d0fb13bd61745f.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607770?t=1765190019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607770?t=1765190019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/1519cf300f9270e1d82c623650da28bd85541795/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765190019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/1519cf300f9270e1d82c623650da28bd85541795/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765190019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game pictures a Jester which can be scary for young audiences. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>Christmas Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/b1122887935004387cf86e0272f76902.avif?t=1765190019\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lift the Evil Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a fallen knight, resurrected within an abandoned castle shrouded in darkness. The only path to freedom lies in completing a sacred ritual to banish the monstrous Jester who stalks these halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run through the castle will feel the same. You\u2019ll need to adapt to different spawns, lingering traps, and unpredictable encounters. Beware of the Jester\u2019s twisted jack boxes scattered throughout the corridors. Trigger one and you\u2019ll summon your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.poster.avif?t=1765190019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.webm?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/6389e6848e607c247efbb202e903809a.mp4?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together or Die Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in online co-op for a terrifying shared experience. Stay close for safety, or split up to cover ground faster, but remember: communication is limited through proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rune you collect brings you closer to freedom, but it also enrages the Jester. As you progress, he grows faster, smarter, and more relentless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.poster.avif?t=1765190019\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.webm?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/extras/0f41788fefa81a50aa8c44ccd07f9ce3.mp4?t=1765190019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-Player Online Co-op</strong>\u00a0- Face the Jester alone or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong>\u00a0- Whisper, shout, or stay silent. Every sound matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jester Sound React</strong> - The Jester has a keen ear, don't make too much noise or you'll attract him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>\u00a0- Each run is  different with new  rune locations, different spawns, key locations,...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Modes</strong>\u00a0- Choose the level of terror that suits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio Design</strong>\u00a0- Feel your heartbeat as the Jester closes in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI</strong>\u00a0- The Jester  grows more dangerous the closer you get to finishing the ritual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Have What It Takes to Lift the Jester\u2019s Curse?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the runes, complete the ritual, and survive the hunt. The Jester is waiting.</p>","developers":["Fire Foot Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607770/d721fc696b602f987d981975b5997805c0fe1491/header.jpg?t=1765190019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3607770/1969687791/5dbe759f63dba1e5da897afdf42763f8b49a3995/1761829743/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764861448","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3607770/1969687791/5dbe759f63dba1e5da897afdf42763f8b49a3995/1761829743/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764861448","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3607770/1969687791/5dbe759f63dba1e5da897afdf42763f8b49a3995/1761829743/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764861448","id":257224647,"name":"Jester: A Foolish Ritual - Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224647/b546802f30c567d27132682bbf822b58c00c2814/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764861448"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3607770/1578679